# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO USE THIS FILE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Choose your CI/CD platform section below.
# 2. Search for every line marked  # TODO  and fill in the correct value.
# 3. Delete the sections for platforms you are NOT using.
# 4. Commit the resulting file to the correct path for your platform:
#      GitHub Actions : .github/workflows/ci.yml
#      GitLab CI/CD   : .gitlab-ci.yml
#      Generic shell  : ci/pipeline.sh  (call from any runner)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


